{
  "info": {
    "name": "AIMess Chat Service",
    "_postman_id": "a1m3ss-chat-0001-collection-0001",
    "description": "Chat-service REST flows for the private + community chat designs.\n\nDEFAULTS connect directly to the services (auth :3001, chat :3004). To go through the API gateway instead, set authBase = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth and chatBase = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat.\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Run 'Auth > Register User A' then 'Register User B' (saves tokens + ids).\n2. Run 'Friends > Send Request' then 'Accept (as Peer)'.\n3. Run 'Private > Get/Create Room' (saves roomId).\n4. Run 'Groups > Create Group' (saves groupRoomId).\n5. 'Community' needs a seeded GeneralRoom; 'Community > List Rooms' saves the first one as communityRoomId.\n6. 'Media > Upload URL' saves objectKey for 'Download URL'.\n\nNOTE: Sending messages, reply, pin, reactions, and location/contact/voice attachments are SOCKET.IO events, NOT REST. See the 'Socket.IO (real-time)' folder description for how to test those in Postman.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "authBase",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001/api/auth"
    },
    {
      "key": "chatBase",
      "value": "http://localhost:3004/api/chat"
    },
    {
      "key": "socketUrl",
      "value": "ws://localhost:3004/z-product"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "peerToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "peerId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "roomId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "groupRoomId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "communityRoomId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "messageId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "objectKey",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User A",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j && j.data && j.data.tokens) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', j.data.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', j.data.user.userId);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('registered or already exists', () => pm.expect([201,200,409]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account\": \"postman_a\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@12345\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authBase}}/register",
              "host": ["{{authBase}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register User B (peer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j && j.data && j.data.tokens) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('peerToken', j.data.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('peerId', j.data.user.userId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account\": \"postman_b\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@12345\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authBase}}/register",
              "host": ["{{authBase}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login User A",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j && j.data && j.data.tokens) { pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', j.data.tokens.accessToken); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account\": \"postman_a\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@12345\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authBase}}/login",
              "host": ["{{authBase}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
